Title: POC: Migrate IMAC Configuration Jenkins Pipeline to GitHub Actions

Description

Created a new GitHub Actions workflow, imac-config-pipeline.yml, to replicate the existing Jenkins pipeline in the CDO/imac-config repository. The workflow is designed to automate dependency scanning, infrastructure validation, security scanning, Terraform planning and deployment, and IMAC configuration compilation.

Changes Implemented

Created a standalone GitHub Actions workflow under .github/workflows/.

Configured automatic execution on pushes to main and manual execution for testing.

Added concurrency controls to prevent overlapping infrastructure deployments.

Configured execution on the existing IMAC self-hosted GitHub Actions runner.

Integrated the existing shared Terraform plan action for the DEV environment.

Added Terraform formatting and validation checks.

Added a Terraform deployment step using the generated plan.

Established integration points for dependency scanning, infrastructure security scanning, and IMAC configuration compilation.
